# Payload build opt-in.
#
# An APK build on one of the branches listed below also builds the embedded
# runtimes by running scripts/prepare-runtime.sh before assets and native
# libraries are merged (see docs/RUNTIME_PAYLOADS.md). That cross-compiles Node
# for Android and packages n8n, so it takes tens of minutes; everything else stays
# fast, and the app then reports NOT_PACKAGED for the missing runtimes instead of
# pretending they exist.
main
